---
// 隱私政策：包含 Google AdSense 要求披露的內容（第三方廣告 Cookie、個性化廣告退出、Google 合作夥伴數據說明）
// 每一條都對應站點實際行為；改動站點的數據處理方式時，請同步更新這裡和 UPDATED
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';

const UPDATED = 'October 12, 2026';
const EMAIL = 'wanghongxiang23@gmail.com';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | OumaShu"
  description="How OumaShu handles data: Google AdSense advertising cookies and how to opt out, the location and weather lookup, local preferences, and your privacy rights."
  keywords="oumashu privacy policy, cookies, google adsense, personalized ads opt out"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="policy">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="OumaShu home">
      <span class="seal" aria-hidden="true" lang="ja">櫻</span>
      <span class="brand__name">OumaShu<span class="brand__ja" lang="ja">櫻滿集</span></span>
    </a>

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="policy__date mono">Last updated: {UPDATED}</p>

    <p>
      OumaShu (oumashu.top, “we”, “us”) is a free directory of online tools. You do not need an account to use it.
      This policy explains what information is processed when you visit oumashu.top, who processes it, and the
      choices you have. It applies to oumashu.top and its language versions (for example /zh-cn/ and /ja/).
    </p>

    <h2 id="summary">Summary</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not ask for your name, email or any account details.</li>
      <li>We show ads from <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. Google and its partners use cookies to serve and measure those ads.</li>
      <li>The home page looks up your approximate city from your IP address to show local time and weather.</li>
      <li>Your theme and language choices are saved only in your own browser.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="advertising">Advertising and cookies (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense to show ads on this site. Ads help pay for keeping OumaShu free.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user’s prior visits to this
        website or other websites.
      </li>
      <li>
        Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their
        visits to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
      </li>
      <li>
        You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
        You can also opt out of some third-party vendors’ use of cookies for personalized advertising at
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>
        and, in Europe, at <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.youronlinechoices.eu</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        If you opt out, you will still see ads, but they will not be personalized. Ads may also be served by
        other ad networks that Google works with, which may use their own cookies.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To learn how Google collects and uses data when you visit sites that use its services, read
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a>.
      For details on the cookies Google uses for advertising, see
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google’s advertising page</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Visitors in the EEA, the UK and Switzerland:</strong> we ask for your consent through a
      Google-certified consent message before personalized ads or advertising cookies are used. You can change your
      choice at any time from the privacy link in that message. Where required, you can also withdraw consent by
      clearing this site’s cookies in your browser.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Visitors in US states with privacy laws:</strong> you can opt out of the use of your information for
      targeted advertising through Google Ads Settings above.
    </p>

    <h2 id="collected">Information processed when you visit</h2>
    <h3>Location and weather on the home page</h3>
    <p>
      To show your local time and weather, your browser sends a request to
      <a href="https://ipapi.co/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ipapi.co</a>, which uses your IP address
      to estimate your city and coordinates. Those approximate coordinates are then sent to
      <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open-Meteo</a> to get the current
      weather. We do not store the result, and it is not used for language selection or for ads.
    </p>
    <h3>Fonts and hosting</h3>
    <p>
      Text fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, so your browser connects to Google’s servers
      (<a href="https://developers.google.com/fonts/faq/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Fonts privacy FAQ</a>).
      The site is hosted on Vercel, which keeps standard server logs (such as IP address, browser type and the page
      requested) to operate and secure the service.
    </p>
    <h3>Analytics</h3>
    <p>We do not currently use any analytics service.</p>
    <h3>Email</h3>
    <p>If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you write, and use it only to reply.</p>

    <h2 id="local-storage">Preferences stored in your browser</h2>
    <p>OumaShu itself does not set cookies. It saves a few preferences in your browser’s local storage:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><code>theme</code>: light, dark or system theme</li>
      <li><code>locale</code>: the language you chose from the language menu</li>
      <li><code>lang-suggest-dismissed</code>: that you closed the “this page is available in your language” prompt</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These values stay on your device and are never sent to us. Clearing your browser’s site data removes them.</p>

    <h2 id="third-party-tools">Tools and sites we link to</h2>
    <p>
      OumaShu links to tools on our own subdomains (such as imghub.oumashu.top) and to third-party websites, which
      are marked “3rd Party”. When you open a tool, that site’s own privacy policy applies. We are not responsible
      for the practices of third-party sites.
    </p>

    <h2 id="rights">Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR or the CCPA), you may have the right to access,
      correct or delete personal information about you, to object to or restrict its processing, and to withdraw
      consent. Because we do not keep accounts, we usually hold no personal data about you; requests about
      advertising data are best made through the Google links above. For anything else, email
      <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 id="children">Children</h2>
    <p>
      OumaShu is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from
      children. If you believe a child has sent us personal information, contact us and we will delete it.
    </p>

    <h2 id="changes">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we change how data is handled, we will update this page and the “Last updated” date above.
    </p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Email: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a><br />
      X (Twitter): <a href="https://x.com/Rollkey4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@Rollkey4</a>
    </p>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 24px 88px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .policy h1 {
    margin: 48px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .policy__date {
    margin: 8px 0 28px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .policy h2 {
    margin: 44px 0 10px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .policy h3 {
    margin: 22px 0 4px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .policy p,
  .policy ul {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .policy ul {
    padding-left: 22px;
    list-style: disc;
  }
  .policy li + li {
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .policy p a,
  .policy li a {
    color: var(--color-brand-ink);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .policy code {
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--wash-strong);
    font: 500 0.88em var(--font-mono);
  }
</style>
